<title>USA: Gabelli group hikes stake in Cablevision.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group hikes stake in Cablevision.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Tuesday it raised its stake in Cablevision Systems Corp to 2,606,678 common shares or 19.61 percent from 18.55 percent previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include a net of 68,100 common shares bought between September 10 and October 4 at prices ranging from $40.0737 to $44.55 per share.</p>
</text>
